The task responsible for calculating the LCM using the given intervals of 36 seconds, 40 seconds, and 48 seconds should be added to the TG. Since the current TG does not include this specific task, we need to define a new task within the TG to handle this calculation.

Here is an updated version of the TG with the necessary task included:

```json
{
    "owner_agent": "CalcDifEq",
    "tasks": {
        "FindLCM": "Calculate the Least Common Multiple (LCM) of the given intervals.",
        "CalculateNextRingTime": "Calculate the next time when all three bells will ring together based on their LCM."
    },
    "orders": [
        {
            "condition": "calculated",
            "from": "FindLCM",
            "to": "CalculateNextRingTime"
        },
        {
            "condition": "calculated",
            "from": "CalculateNextRingTime",
            "to": "End"
        }
    ],
    "refused": false,
    "answer": null
}
```

In this updated TG, the `FindLCM` task is responsible for calculating the LCM of 36 seconds, 40 seconds, and 48 seconds. The result from this task will then be used by the `CalculateNextRingTime` task to determine when all three bells will ring together again.
